@startuml
title UC01 Place and Manage Orders | FR01-FR07, BR1-BR17
footer Owner 524H0072 | AI-assisted design for owner review
start
:Authenticate; check ownership for existing order;
if (Create?) then (yes)
 :Select active hub, lines, address and optional voucher;
 :Read time/load/rain placement context;
 :Validate BR1, BR2, BR8, BR12;
 if (Valid?) then (yes)
  :Calculate breakdown in BR10 order; round once BR11;
  :Choose method; validate customer group and COD cap;
  :Customer confirms authoritative quote;
  :Invoke selected simulated payment strategy;
  if (Successful?) then (yes)
   :Save Placed order, lines, snapshot, payment and history atomically;
  else (no)
   :Show failure; no partial order;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Show errors or alternative hubs;
 endif
elseif (Read?) then (yes)
 :Return own orders, breakdown and history;
elseif (Edit?) then (yes)
 if (Current state Placed?) then (yes)
  :Validate edited lines; price using stored context BR17;
  :Simulate adjustment under AMB03/AMB05;
  if (Adjustment and concurrency checks succeed?) then (yes)
   :Commit new lines, breakdown and adjustment;
  else (no)
   :Retain original order/amount; reload if stale;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Reject edit;
 endif
else (Cancel)
 if (Current state Placed or Confirmed?) then (yes)
  :Set Cancelled; fully mock-refund online payment;
  :Append history; retain records;
 else (no)
  :Reject cancellation;
 endif
endif
stop
@enduml
